Your screenshot shows the real problem.
This line is wrong in config.log:
ac_cv_env_LDFLAGS_value='-L/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib -Wl,-rpath,/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/libLD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib'
Notice this bad part:
libLD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib
That means your LDFLAGS and LD_LIBRARY_PATH got accidentally joined together because of a missing space or broken line continuation.
So the compiler failed because the linker flags are malformed.

