Important syntax lesson
This is good:
export LDFLAGS="-L/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib -Wl,-rpath,/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib"export LD_LIBRARY_PATH="/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib"
This is bad because it accidentally joins both values:
LDFLAGS="-L/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib -Wl,-rpath,/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib"LD_LIBRARY_PATH="/opt/openssl-1.1.1w/lib"
There must be a space, newline, or separate export command between them.